'' RUN: a correct program under -fsanitize=address -mt has no report and exits 0 -- strings, dynamic
'' arrays, a destructor, Optional, a container, ON ERROR's jump to a handler (the runtime's
'' longjmp, uninstrumented) and a thread: the false-positive check.
'' TEST: cli
'' HOSTS: windows
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' ARGS: -g -mt -fsanitize=address --no-module-cache -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/asan-clean.tiko -o tests/codegen/asanclean.exe
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/asanclean.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: caught 5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: thread 7
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: done
